{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5931d9fa0dadb2e12d3bd73c6f2bd00c123c9166dd5dbd153f9524734057e9b2", "ja": "（航空会社のCMにも使われるPVの撮影に、\n千早と共にやってきた）", "zh": "（我和千早一起来到了拍摄PV的现场，\nPV的内容也会用在航空公司的广告中。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "555f962f4d58f4a3a05ee5df620a014a9b5968bea310d8387a3d49391b75a300", "ja": "旅に出よう。今すぐに。\n夏の青空が、私を呼んでいる……。", "zh": "就是现在，启程去旅行吧。\n夏日的蓝天在呼唤着我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1002_null", "source_sha256": "a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78", "ja": "休憩中……", "zh": "休息中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a2fd4ac3bd0048cfc54548f8e29f984cf17b1244d6285667f3aa2cfe917edad4", "ja": "千早、お疲れさま！\nいい演技じゃないか。かなり調子いいみたいだな！", "zh": "千早，辛苦了！\n你演得很棒耶，感觉你的状况不错喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "1331ef88541c3f7e18f27128f64b897d5075b1551820ccb8b6b0110f2e038a70", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nおかげさまで、今のところ順調です。", "zh": "{$P$}，你辛苦了。\n托你的福，目前一切都还顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a0c1873a7c71385971dec432fccb72a74ea8d5b112802e1ac2b53cc0e755ed41", "ja": "順調どころか、スポンサーも大喜びだ。\nイメージ以上、だそうだぞ！", "zh": "何止顺利，赞助商也赞不绝口喔，\n说你的表现超出预期呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "7d4fe8618e52ae1a62999e410a2b8d4517480d51e9e7694f9d09b52cd16e0d31", "ja": "本当ですか？　……なら、よかったです。\n私としても、とても楽しい仕事ですから。", "zh": "真的吗？……那就好。\n我自己也觉得这份工作非常有趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "5df99ba46e5d4621436da8be3cf0091235d2ecf94a281ad63086a4c181098062", "ja": "でも、あの……。", "zh": "可是，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "2cc95e43c242ceb193fb858d375281b2e0898e72b9bb897014e90cd48044d11f", "ja": "{$P$}からは、何かありませんか？\n気になる点や、不安なこととか。", "zh": "{$P$}，你看完有没有什么想法呢？\n有没有觉得哪里怪怪的，或是担心哪里会出问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3544bc64e55ed8c1429f908c9501ebd22f90a70bb1d2802c58085471925ba6cf", "ja": "え？　いや、特にないけど……\n千早自身には、何か不安があるのか？", "zh": "咦？我是没觉得怎样……\n千早自己有担心的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "0e3a85d585846b80cccccdb930b6aad78bc9f63b8fe2c79f95a10bb7567225ba", "ja": "不安、とまではいきませんが。ただ順調なときほど、\n思わぬ落とし穴があるものですから。", "zh": "也不算是担心，只是事情进行得越是顺利，\n往往就会发生意料之外的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "7dc4a68ed03a83024b9b750855028207b4eab87e9642e14c61b447b77b7280ba", "ja": "それに……、そうですね、\nまだ演技には、自信が持てていません。", "zh": "而且……这个嘛，\n我对自己的演技也没自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "531f92e15239cef86f11793a38cead2f396cdc358624d3a3cb788ae779bd5924", "ja": "のびのびと自由に、空を飛んでいるような表情で、\nというオファーでしたよね。でも……。", "zh": "这份工作邀约指定的，是要轻松自在、\n像在空中翱翔的表情，没有错吧？可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "97510b19b321e00d058049c2a51f1b6caab6aba38921333cd00ef230317f3285", "ja": "私は、本当に空を飛んだことがありませんから。", "zh": "我没有真的飞起来过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "233497b53d1302942181cc32a3741a566bd98c7b48b062fbbe69b87d8cc5df8e", "ja": "……まあ、そうだろうな。\n人間は飛べないしな……。", "zh": "……哎，也是啦，\n毕竟人是不会飞的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "bc08dc6b47328efe72289dfc6f4f18df814634f031321859a0d360978c060e27", "ja": "ですから、想像の翼を広げて……。\n歌を歌うイメージでやってみています。", "zh": "所以，我张开了想像中的翅膀……\n试着用唱歌的概念来拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "00f2e2b218d4ef4905c3de51002ff32daa67c2d2cd91ff455770a349713c89af", "ja": "それでいいと思う。みんなに好評だし。\n実際今にも飛び立ちそうな、いい雰囲気だったぞ！", "zh": "我觉得这样很好，且大家也觉得很棒。\n你刚刚的感觉真的就像要振翅起飞一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "f16efabe293e1d0b2cb815c8b88f050b563e36e16533bdd7504e89ad954f8fa5", "ja": "そうですか……。{$P$}の目にも\nそう映っていたのなら、良かったです。", "zh": "这样啊……\n{$P$}看起来也有这种感觉就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "e437b0417c641abe24e33fad0f845225e9500dfb7a5d3dfe50633d30bbbbcb34", "ja": "歌っている時なら、このまま本当に飛び立てると感じる\nこともあるので……少しは経験がいきているのかと。", "zh": "我在唱歌时，偶尔真的会有自己要飞起来的感觉……\n我想是这样的经验派上了用场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1019_p", "source_sha256": "272077c6dfc603c6f30d4fec03dd6a4fada4edb6c9e8d4b3984d788a3f5b0434", "ja": "歌も演技も、感情を表現する点では同じだから。\nこれも千早が、ずっと歌と向き合ってきた成果だな！", "zh": "不论是唱歌还是演戏，都是需要表达情感的。\n这也是千早一直勇于面对歌唱带来的成果吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "c602e382c7f764251950f9fc003955d275d73cee4f86741d03f775a486ee6b1a", "ja": "そ、そんな……。あまり褒めないでください。\n撮影はまだ終わっていません。慢心は禁物かと。", "zh": "太、太夸张了……请不要这样夸我。\n拍摄的工作还没结束，我可不能自负起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "8b7790e225f7cf894430b3568a6a56e7fbe2b04e6e2701ca67c8b338bf7c5516", "ja": "それに……。私だけの成果にするのは、\nその……。不公平です。", "zh": "而且……将这些成果算在我一个人头上，\n那个……有失公允。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7753404021ee53537a2d8f4e504611f1a45f2f652f829a377afc772e56db6bb3", "ja": "え？　なにが不公平なんだ？", "zh": "咦？为什么会有失公允？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "0515c66b8c1212e25b95178c55643305e7236a9079377522f519432af49c20d1", "ja": "だって、私に翼と、自由な空をくれたのは……\n{$P$}ですから。", "zh": "因为，给了我翅膀，还有自由天空的人……\n就是{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "d425b0cd20a239691916e9760cc3a1a20bfab04cf80730f9d91125af37e5fb62", "ja": "私達ふたりの成果、としないと……\n不公平です。", "zh": "如果不说这是我们两个的成果……\n会有失公允。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1025_p", "source_sha256": "034b5ea74e1c8c97541c441151b8ec18eaf326ab7c5b3c563f487fcd1ab4f187", "ja": "……そうだったな。じゃあ公平に、\n今回の撮影の出来はふたりの成果という事で……。", "zh": "……说得也是，那就公正地说，\n这次拍摄工作的成功，是我们一起打造的成果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1026_p", "source_sha256": "fb0686d56071d90e4bb50c12d05ff872eceb60739ced070b5421ba1df5056096", "ja": "残りの撮影でもしっかり飛び立って、\n最高の成果を2人分、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "剩下的进度也要好好翱翔，\n拜托你飞出两人份的成果啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1027_002chi", "source_sha256": "b9ea97bc5c9335d29753c0b1930a987a22ee48bc3a5ea3f5d6adfb9c86624fbe", "ja": "……はいっ！　任せてください、\n{$P$}。必ず飛んでみせます。", "zh": "……好的！请交给我吧，{$P$}。\n我一定会飞起来给你看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0084_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "c9376f8aac78bec114005acf32a9a7afc4a43adbebe5b98f949f65aa47c189d2", "ja": "{$P$}と一緒に……\nどこまでも高く、遠くへ！", "zh": "我要和{$P$}一起……\n飞往更高、更远的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
